# Planted bugs in the recorded history. Each one must make the declared
# outcome fail.
run fv-elle History.edn
properties G2-item G-single-item-realtime
file History.edn

mutation process 1 hides that process 0's append already committed
detects G2-item
- {:index 3, :type :ok,     :process 1, :value [[:append 2 20] [:r 1 [10]]]}
+ {:index 3, :type :ok,     :process 1, :value [[:append 2 20] [:r 1 []]]}

mutation process 0's reread misses process 1's already-committed append
detects G-single-item-realtime
- {:index 5, :type :ok,     :process 0, :value [[:r 1 [10]] [:r 2 [20]]]}
+ {:index 5, :type :ok,     :process 0, :value [[:r 1 [10]] [:r 2 []]]}

harmless extra whitespace in the first operation
- {:index 0, :type :invoke, :process 0, :value [[:append 1 10] [:r 2 nil]]}
+ {:index 0, :type :invoke, :process 0, :value [[:append 1 10] [:r 2 nil]] }
